  "structured risk profile returned to your underwriting queue via API": "ta tuzilmali risk profili API orqali koʻrib chiqish navbatingizga keladi",

  "02 — THE FLOW": "02 — JARAYON", "From application link to underwriting signal.": "Ariza havolasidan qaror signaligacha.",
  "Four stages. No integration required to start — a link works.": "Toʻrt bosqich. Boshlash uchun integratsiya kerak emas — havolaning oʻzi yetarli.",
  "Applicant receives a link": "Arizachi havola oladi",
  "Sent by your officer, embedded in your form, or opened in branch on a tablet. No app, no bureau lookup, no document upload.": "Havolani xodimingiz yuboradi, u arizangiz shakliga joylanadi yoki filialda planshetda ochiladi. Ilova, byuroga soʻrov va hujjat yuklash kerak emas.",
  "Adaptive assessment runs": "Moslashuvchan baholash oʻtkaziladi",
  "Each answer narrows the next item. A 500-item bank means no two sessions follow the same path, which makes answers much harder to memorise or coach.": "Har bir javob keyingi savolni belgilaydi. 500 ta savoldan iborat bank tufayli ikki sessiya bir xil yoʻldan bormaydi, shuning uchun javoblarni yodlab olish yoki oʻrgatish ancha qiyin.",
  "Validity layer screens the session": "Ishonchlilik qatlami sessiyani tekshiradi",
  "Response latency, answer streaks, internal contradictions and window-switching are scored. Suspect sessions are flagged for review, not silently scored.": "Javob tezligi, bir xil javoblar ketma-ketligi, ichki ziddiyatlar va oyna almashtirish baholanadi. Shubhali sessiyalar jimgina baholanmaydi — ular tekshiruvga yuboriladi.",
  "Profile lands in your queue": "Profil navbatingizga tushadi",
  "Overall score, band, six dimension scores, validity verdict and reasoning — in the console or pushed to your systems over the API.": "Umumiy ball, toifa, olti oʻlchov boʻyicha ballar, ishonchlilik xulosasi va izoh — panelda yoki API orqali tizimlaringizda.",
