  "03 — THE ENGINE": "03 — DVIGATEL", "Signals in. Behavioural profile out. Matched to your product.": "Kirishda — signallar. Chiqishda — mahsulotingizga moslangan xulq-atvor profili.",
  "Every answer is distributed across six dimensions, checked by the validity layer, then fitted against the risk appetite of the product being applied for.": "Har bir javob olti oʻlchovga taqsimlanadi, ishonchlilik qatlamida tekshiriladi va soʻralayotgan mahsulotning risk ishtahasi bilan solishtiriladi.",
  "Answers": "Javoblar", "500-item adaptive bank": "500 savollik moslashuvchan bank",
