  "04 — WHAT IS MEASURED": "04 — NIMA OʻLCHANADI", "Six dimensions, scored independently.": "Olti oʻlchov, har biri alohida baholanadi.",
  "Each dimension is derived from psychometric constructs in the published behavioural-credit literature and mapped to items in the bank. Hover a dimension to isolate it.": "Har bir oʻlchov xulq-atvorga asoslangan kreditlash boʻyicha nashr etilgan tadqiqotlardagi psixometrik tushunchalarga tayanadi va bankdagi savollarga bogʻlangan. Oʻlchovni ajratib koʻrish uchun kursorni ustiga olib boring.",
  "Responsibility": "Masʼuliyat", "Integrity": "Halollik", "Self-control": "Oʻzini nazorat qilish",
  "Risk control": "Riskni nazorat qilish", "Money habits": "Pul odatlari", "Planning": "Rejalashtirish",
  "Follow-through on commitments — does the applicant finish what they start, and honour arrangements without external pressure?": "Majburiyatlarni bajarish: arizachi boshlagan ishini oxiriga yetkazadimi va kelishuvlarga tashqi bosimsiz rioya qiladimi?",
  "Consistency between stated intent and reported behaviour, cross-checked by contradictory item pairs across the session.": "Bildirilgan niyat va taʼriflangan xatti-harakat oʻrtasidagi muvofiqlik. U sessiya davomida zid savol juftliklari bilan tekshiriladi.",
  "Impulse regulation under pressure: delayed gratification, reaction to windfalls, and spending under emotional load.": "Bosim ostida istaklarni boshqarish: kutilmagan daromadga munosabat, rohatni kechiktira olish va hissiy holatdagi xarajatlar.",
  "Attitude to downside exposure — how the applicant sizes a bet, and whether they hold a buffer against shocks.": "Yoʻqotish xavfiga munosabat: arizachi qancha tavakkal qiladi va kutilmagan holatlar uchun zaxira saqlaydimi.",
  "Everyday money mechanics: tracking, prioritising obligations, and behaviour in a cash shortfall.": "Kundalik pul muomalasi: hisob yuritish, majburiyatlarni ustuvorlik boʻyicha tartiblash va pul yetishmaganda oʻzini tutish.",
  "Horizon length and structure — whether decisions are made against a plan or reactively, month to month.": "Rejalashtirish ufqi va tuzilishi: qarorlar reja asosida qabul qilinadimi yoki oydan oyga vaziyatga qarab.",

  "05 — TRY IT": "05 — SINAB KOʻRING", "Three items. Watch the profile move.": "Uchta savol. Profil qanday oʻzgarishini kuzating.",
  "A miniature of the real assessment — the live version runs 30–45 adaptive items across the full bank.": "Haqiqiy baholashning kichik nusxasi: toʻliq versiya butun bankdan 30–45 ta moslashuvchan savol beradi.",
  "ITEM": "SAVOL", "LIVE PROFILE": "JONLI PROFIL", "AWAITING INPUT": "JAVOB KUTILMOQDA", "Reset": "Qaytadan",
  "A supplier offers a 20% discount if you pay for six months up front. It would take most of your cash buffer.": "Yetkazib beruvchi olti oy uchun oldindan toʻlasangiz 20% chegirma taklif qilmoqda. Bu pul zaxirangizning katta qismini oladi.",
  "Take it — the discount is guaranteed money": "Qabul qilaman — chegirma aniq foyda",
  "Negotiate a smaller prepayment for a partial discount": "Qisman chegirma evaziga kamroq oldindan toʻlov haqida kelishaman",
  "Decline — the buffer is not for this": "Rad etaman — zaxira bunga moʻljallanmagan",
  "A repayment is due on the 10th. On the 8th an urgent family expense comes up that would use the same money.": "Kredit toʻlovi oyning 10-sanasida. 8-sanada xuddi shu pulni talab qiladigan shoshilinch oilaviy xarajat chiqib qoldi.",
