  "09 — ROADMAP": "09 — YOʻL XARITASI", "Where we are, and where this goes.": "Hozir qayerdamiz va qayerga boramiz.",
  "Six stages, from a working platform to a national credit profile. We are in Stage 1 now.": "Ishlayotgan platformadan milliy kredit profiligacha olti bosqich. Hozir 1-bosqichdamiz.",
  "DONE": "BAJARILDI", "NOW": "HOZIR", "NEXT": "KEYINGI",
  "Platform & method": "Platforma va metodika", "Research, 500-item adaptive bank, anti-cheat layer, full platform in three languages.": "Tadqiqot, 500 savollik moslashuvchan bank, aldovdan himoya qatlami, uch tildagi toʻliq platforma.",
  "Data & funding": "Maʼlumot va moliyalashtirish", "Train on 500–700 real applicants. Partner conversations with banks, MFIs, insurers. Raise.": "500–700 real arizachida oʻqitish. Banklar, MMTlar va sugʻurta kompaniyalari bilan muzokaralar. Investitsiya jalb qilish.",
  "Harden the method": "Metodikani mustahkamlash", "Fuse behavioural signals with live financial data; continuous recalibration on outcomes.": "Xulq-atvor signallarini moliyaviy maʼlumotlar bilan birlashtirish; natijalar asosida doimiy qayta kalibrlash.",
  "International": "Xalqaro bozor", "Agreements with behavioural fintechs abroad; connect non-bank data — transactions, tax, utilities.": "Xorijdagi xulq-atvor fintexlari bilan kelishuvlar; bankdan tashqari maʼlumotlarni ulash — tranzaksiyalar, soliq, kommunal toʻlovlar.",
  "Scale": "Kengayish", "Contracts across microfinance, insurance and BNPL; commercial banks; state credit programmes.": "Mikromoliya, sugʻurta va BNPL sohalarida shartnomalar; tijorat banklari; davlat kredit dasturlari.",
  "National profile": "Milliy profil", "An open national credit profile — one trust standard, carried by the person, not the bureau.": "Ochiq milliy kredit profili — byuroga emas, insonning oʻziga tegishli yagona ishonch standarti.",

  "10 — TEAM": "10 — JAMOA", "Built by people from inside Uzbek banking.": "Oʻzbekiston bank sohasidan chiqqan jamoa yaratgan.",
  "We have sat on the lender's side of the desk and seen creditworthy applicants turned away for lack of a file.": "Biz kreditor tomonida ishlaganmiz va toʻlovga qodir arizachilar kredit tarixi yoʻqligi uchun rad etilganini koʻrganmiz.",
  "FOUNDER · CEO": "ASOSCHI · CEO", "CO-FOUNDER": "HAMMUASSIS",
  "Banking and finance: IFRS reporting and expected-credit-loss models, business development, and observer in the SQB privatisation negotiations. ACCA candidate.": "Bank va moliya: MHXS hisobotlari va kutilayotgan kredit zararlari modellari, biznesni rivojlantirish, SQB xususiylashtirish muzokaralarida kuzatuvchi. ACCA nomzodi.",

  "11 — QUESTIONS": "11 — SAVOLLAR", "The questions risk teams ask first.": "Risk jamoalari birinchi beradigan savollar.",
  "Something not covered here? Put it in the pilot request and we will answer it directly.": "Javob topilmadimi? Savolingizni pilot soʻroviga yozing, toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri javob beramiz.",
