  "12 — PILOT": "12 — PILOT", "Put it in front of 500–700 real applicants.": "500–700 real arizachida sinab koʻring.",
  "Tell us your portfolio and the segment you keep declining for lack of data. We will come back with a pilot scope, a timeline, and what we need from your side.": "Portfelingiz va maʼlumot yetishmagani uchun rad etayotgan segmentingiz haqida yozing. Biz pilot hajmi, muddatlari va siz tomondan nima kerakligi haqida taklif bilan qaytamiz.",
